# Regression and build proof

For an application code change, run these when the environment can run them:

- `pnpm tsc --noEmit --pretty false`
- `pnpm run build`
- the targeted check for the corridor you changed
- one failure path when the change affects saving, units, authentication, or billing

A previous report, a ledger status, or a successful compile is not proof of the user-visible path.

If a command cannot be run, say which command and why. Do not mark the task verified.

A documentation-only change does not require the application build. `evidence-before-pass.mdc` still requires the actual result of every check you do run.
